'''Spencer James George''' (born October 28, 1973) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[running back]] for the [[Tennessee Titans|Tennessee Oilers/Titans]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[Rice Owls football|Rice Owls]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/G/GeorSp00.htm|title=Spencer George Stats|website=Pro-Football-Reference.com}}</ref>
